---
title: A request, end to end
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reader
    participant API as Reading API
    participant Cache
    Reader->>+API: Open a saved article
    API->>+Cache: Find the article
    Cache-->>-API: Cached document
    API->>+API: Build the response
    API-->>-API: Response ready
    Note right of API: Keep the original<br>publication date
    API-->>-Reader: Article and reading position
    API--)Metrics: Record latency
    Note left of Reader: Reading view
    Note over Reader,Cache: The article is ready to read
